 "title": "PH series: 2.0 mm pitch crimp wire-to-board connectors (S4B-PH-K-S four-circuit side-entry through-hole header)",
 "source": {
  "document": "PH connector",
  "revision": "no revision printed; PDF dated 2012-12",
  "pages": 3
 },
 "summary": "The PH family joins crimped internal wires to a circuit board on a 2.0 mm pitch, in one row of 2 to 16 circuits. It has crimp contacts for AWG #32 to #24 wire, a housing (PHR) and fully shrouded headers: through-hole top and side entry, a low-insertion-force through-hole version, and SMT top and side entry with solder tabs. Each contact carries 2 A at AWG #24 and is rated 100 V AC or DC over -25 to +85 °C. S4B-PH-K-S(LF)(SN) is the four-circuit side-entry through-hole header: the housing plugs in parallel to the board, the body is 9.9 mm long and stands 4.8 mm above the board, and it ships 500 to a box.",
