  {
   "topic": "S4B-PH-K-S",
   "page": 2,
   "text": "The four-circuit side-entry header takes a PHR-4 housing with SPH contacts. Its posts are on a 2.0 mm pitch with 6.0 mm from circuit 1 to circuit 4, the body is 9.9 mm long, 4.8 mm high above the board and 6 mm deep along the mating direction, and the tails sit in one row 6.25 mm back from the mating face. Holes are 0.7 mm (+0.1/0) on the 2 mm pitch. Posts are brass, copper-undercoated and tin-plated; the wafer is natural (white) PA 66, UL94V-0."
  }
